  "prompt": "Voltmarkt sorts its customers by the days from their most recent order to the as-of date, 5 January 2026: 'active' for 0 to 30 days, 'cooling' for 31 to 90 days, and 'lapsed' for more than 90 days. Take each customer's latest order day in UTC (order times are stored in UTC) and count the days between that day and the as-of date. Guest orders have no customer_id and do not count. Return two columns, in this order: recency_band, and customers. Return one row for each band that has customers. Any row order is fine.",
